// ===[ GPU trace ]===
// For the frames main.c asks for (CtrRenderer_traceNextFrame), the log lists
// each GX command the GPU ran and its time ("[gputrace]"): every batch the
// game projection draws gets a command list of its own (the frame is split
// after it), and each list, fill and copy is shown with what it draws or the
// surfaces it touches. The splits cost the GPU a little time of their own and
// run the GX queue more often (see reserveGxCommands), so a traced frame is
