// One axis of a fine draw in native drawing (smartEmitAveraged): the quad from
// surface pixel a0 to a1 (whole pixels, a1 > a0) shows texels t0 to t1
// (t1 - t0 = a1 - a0, or a0 - a1 mirrored). Each half-resolution pixel
// samples where its two columns meet, the average of the texels there, which
// is right wherever both are the item's. A pixel whose pair straddles the
// item's edge (a0 or a1 odd) would take a texel beyond it, a neighbour's on
// the page, so it gets a span of its own sampled at the edge texel's centre,
