// each ripple is a rectangle round rippleCenter, of which the shader keeps
// a ring by the pixel's distance d from the centre. With rippleRad = (R,
// max, T) and e = d - (R - T), alpha is min(e, 1) times 0.6, 0.8 or 1 by
// the third of the ring's thickness T that e falls in, times a fade by R;
