// with everything it depends on, and is drawn only once something needs the
// surface's pixels: drawing it in view or sampling it any other way, reading
// it, or drawing on it otherwise. A clear of the whole surface drops what
// waits, as nothing of it would show; so does freeing it. A surface a waiting
