// the line at row 1024 between an RGBA5551 tile and an RGBA8 one) was left sharp beside Kris's averaged one
// (lopsided); about 500 items over Chapters 1-4's pages are in the same case.
// Cmdlabel_smartMix decides such an item first, from its colours read one way: as RGBA5551 (with the packer's
// rounding) when a tile it lies over is RGBA5551, else as 8-bit RGBA. Its verdict is itemVerdict's, step for step
// (the 2x2-block test, size, colours, ink kept at some phase, keepSharp, the clean test), and it goes in the same
